  "description": "Something solid. Hard-wearing. Fast. A real escape from the steady pull of the digital: the OMNIUM x Carhartt WIP Mini-Max.\n\nThe first collaboration between Danish bicycle brand OMNIUM and Carhartt WIP takes OMNIUM’s original Mini-Max as its starting point, reworking the bike from its standard chromoly construction into a tough, premium stainless steel frame. To keep its raw appearance, the frame is clear-coated, leaving high-quality welds and heat discoloration visible. The bike is available in three sizes (S/M/L), and limited to 150 units.\n\nAcid yellow and black co-branded graphics lend an industrial, hi-vis character throughout, appearing across its DT Swiss cargo wheels, cargo webbing, lock-on foam grips, and titanium-railed saddle.\n\nThe bike also includes special-edition MKS x Carhartt WIP XC-III “bear trap” pedals, via Blue Lug Japan, nodding to Carhartt WIP’s history in BMX. They feature a custom matte-black colorway with hand-painted embossed branding and C-Logo cutouts in the cages.",
